---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="ReWaste BSF — Plateforme Hybride de Bioconversion & Élevage BSF en Côte d'Ivoire"
  description="Pépinière centrale, approvisionnement en jeunes larves 5-DOL, formation pratique, SaaS Colony Manager et valorisation des biodéchets industriels."
>
  <!-- Hero Section Moderne & Impactante -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900 via-emerald-800 to-green-900 text-white py-20 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#fff_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-emerald-200 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10">
          <span class="material-icons text-sm">recycling</span>
          Modèle Hybride • Pépinière Centrale & Réseau de Fermes Satellites
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Transformez les Biodéchets en <span class="text-emerald-400">Protéines & Fertilisants</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-emerald-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
          La première bio-industrie circulaire d'Afrique de l'Ouest : formation professionnelle, fourniture de jeunes larves 5-DOL, pilotage terrain hors-ligne et valorisation certifiée.
        </p>

        <!-- Grille de CTA rapides -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-4">
          <a
            href="/calculator"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-emerald-950 font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">calculate</span>
            <span>Simulateur BSF Calculator</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/boutique"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/20 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">shopping_cart</span>
            <span>Commander des 5-DOL</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/colony-manager"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-800/80 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-medium px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-600 transition-all"
          >
            <span class="material-icons text-xl">offline_bolt</span>
            <span>Colony Manager (Hors-Ligne)</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-6 text-xs text-emerald-200/90">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="material-icons text-sm text-emerald-400">verified</span>
            Basé sur les SOPs EAWAG / FiBL
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="material-icons text-sm text-emerald-400">payments</span>
            Paiements Mobile Wave Côte d'Ivoire
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="material-icons text-sm text-emerald-400">location_on</span>
            Pépinière Centrale : Abidjan - Songon
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Les 5 Piliers du Business Plan -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Écosystème BSF Intégré
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-3">
          Une Plateforme Bâtie sur 5 Piliers Opérationnels
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mt-3 text-base">
          Conçue pour soutenir l'entrepreneuriat rural, la sécurité alimentaire animale et la gestion écologique des déchets industriels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Pilier 1 : Hub Pédagogique & Calculateur -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">school</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600">Pilier A • Gratuit & Libre</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3">Hub & Simulateurs BSF</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              4 chapitres complets de cours, le BSF Calculator pour dimensionner vos gisements, et le Wizard interactif de diagnostic terrain.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/calculator" class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Lancer le simulateur</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilier 2 : Formations Présentielles & Wave -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">groups</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600">Pilier B • Formations</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3">Formations Pratiques à Songon</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Parcours intensifs de 1 à 5 jours : initiation, maîtrise technique du cycle et business plan industriel. Réservation avec Wave.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/formations" class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-800 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Voir les sessions (FCFA)</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilier 3 : Intrants 5-DOL & Matériel -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">storefront</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600">Pilier C • E-Commerce</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3">Intrants 5-DOL & Équipements</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Approvisionnement régulier en doses de 25k ou 50k jeunes larves, bacs Larveros calibrés, pièges à fourmis et farine protéique dégraissée.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/boutique" class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Visiter la boutique</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilier 4 : SaaS Colony Manager Local-First -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">offline_bolt</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">Pilier D • SaaS Éleveur</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3">SaaS "My Colony Manager"</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Remplace les fiches papier. Saisie des pesées 100% hors-ligne (Dexie.js), calcul instantané du taux de conversion (BCR %) et alertes température.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/colony-manager" class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-700 hover:text-purple-800 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Ouvrir l'outil de suivi</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilier 5 : B2B Gate Fees & RSE -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm border border-gray-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">corporate_fare</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">Pilier E • Gate Fees B2B</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1 mb-3">Portail Déchets & RSE</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Service aux supermarchés, brasseries et municipalités : traitement de 10k à 20k FCFA/tonne, bons de pesée et certificats de réduction d'émissions $CO_2$.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/b2b" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 hover:text-emerald-700 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Espace professionnel</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Carte Diagnostic rapide -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-600 text-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/20 text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <span class="material-icons text-2xl">troubleshoot</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-200">Aide à la Décision</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-3">Un problème dans votre élevage ?</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-100 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Larves qui rampent, odeurs d'ammoniac, invasion de fourmis ou faible ponte : consultez immédiatement notre arbre de diagnostic expert.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="/diagnostic" class="text-sm font-bold text-white hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Diagnostiquer mon bac</span>
              <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bannière Présentation Modèle Hybride -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-950 to-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white shadow-xl">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">
              Scénario 2 — Business Plan Officiel
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-heading">
              Pourquoi le Modèle Pépinière Centrale + Satellites ?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              La gestion d'un insectarium complet présente des risques biologiques élevés en milieu rural. Notre Unité Centrale stabilise la reproduction et vous livre des <strong>larves de 5 jours (5-DOL) prêtes à l'engraissement</strong>. En 12 jours, vos biodéchets sont convertis en récoltes commercialisables.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
              <a
                href="/formations#inscription"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-emerald-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all"
              >
                <span>Rejoindre le Réseau Satellite</span>
                <span class="material-icons text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
              <a
                href="/chapter4"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-all border border-white/10"
              >
                <span>Lire l'Analyse Économique</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-4">
            <div class="text-center pb-3 border-b border-white/10">
              <span class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-400">80%</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-300 block">Réduction de masse des déchets</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center pb-3 border-b border-white/10">
              <span class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-400">12 Jours</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-300 block">Cycle de grossissement chez le partenaire</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <span class="text-3xl font-black text-emerald-400">55% PB</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-300 block">Taux de protéines de la farine BSF</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
